{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emergent Storytelling</strong></h2><strong>Ruinarch</strong> is a simulation sandbox game where you use all the infernal tools at your disposal to manifest conflicts and toy with people's lives in procedurally generated fantasy worlds. Flipping the table on story generator games like Rimworld and Dwarf Fortress, you are now the one weaving tales full of drama and dark comedy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Playstyles</strong></h2>There are many ways to be evil. Choose from three overlord Archetypes - each one provides you with a different playstyle. Do you want to focus on sheer destruction or are you into a more subtle puppetmaster approach?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mix your own Cocktail of Evil Spells</strong></h2>What happens when you hurl a meteor at a poisonous puddle? Poisonous meteor explosions, that's what! And that's just one of the many nefarious ways that you can combine elemental interactions to create your personalized cocktail of destruction!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/fd0812857d3502a872343414e80b4d3c.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/fd0812857d3502a872343414e80b4d3c.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/fd0812857d3502a872343414e80b4d3c.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn villagers against each other</strong></h2>Simply destroying the world with ice and fire is for amateurs. The real fun begins when you meddle with villagers to create a custom made demonic soap opera! Afflict the local hero with Lycanthropy and watch as his childhood friends turn on him when the full moon rises. Afflict a previously loving husband with Unfaithfulness and then watch the fireworks once you tell his wife of his infidelity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/09e88a7ba8d5d39d8980c0dca7e4aaca.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/09e88a7ba8d5d39d8980c0dca7e4aaca.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/09e88a7ba8d5d39d8980c0dca7e4aaca.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spawn monsters to kidnap and harass villagers</strong></h2>Snatch or seize a roaming monster and then breed it to have very specific functions in your Kennel.Then unleash monster parties to snatch Villagers or raid Villages!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spread some Gossip</strong></h2>Your Beholder Structure allows you to spawn Eyes all over the world to gather information. You've seen a Knight steal a Shaman's Potion? Store it as an Intel and then tell the Shaman about it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create a customized Plague</strong></h2>Build a Biolab to afflict Villagers with Plague and summon Plagued Rats. Upgrade your plague to instill it with various nasty symptoms and improve its virulence. You can even make Plagued victims explode when they die!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infiltrate the Village secret Cultists</strong></h2>Captured villagers can be taken to your prison and brainwashed into cultists! Cultists will secretly worship you and aid your return into the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start a Zombie Apocalypse</strong></h2>Make the Plagued dead rise as zombies. Other villagers that they attack may also contract the virus. Soon, the entire village will be filled with nothing but shambling zombies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the Creatures of the Night</strong></h2>Afflict a Villager with Vampirism or Lycanthropy to turn them into denizens of the night. Watch as they terrorize their neighbors and spread the curse! You may eventually see the Village fight back and start Vampire and Lycan Hunts.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Like Slow Deaths?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/fb828450714d4965d5e7b0f15864bdc33503cb6c.jpg"},{"name":"I Am The Boogeyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/eb5da318a3c7ace7166ccfd0092d1705df27431f.jpg"},{"name":"You Sneaky Bastard!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/305619a4651f308a6fd741d735630e1cc35c2917.jpg"},{"name":"Is That You, Lucifer?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/5d9f8b8005e11f1bd75cc25a6e5c5e5b05f90eb4.jpg"},{"name":"Kneel Before Me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/a407b6c6494c87d44d4c1fa64cc975b6b9fe28a1.jpg"},{"name":"A Good Ol' Destruction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/e3070282035dd81a7cf1afc768fdd42437915948.jpg"},{"name":"It Takes One, To Make One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/9e0284f93d66af8ae7719b834ca372eb27baf49e.jpg"},{"name":"Tear Them Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/9b6a53f4dba83a85da314cae90862f11a6349846.jpg"},{"name":"All I See Is Blood II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/a0c3cbde2b1ac73e22f126ad81b94b3ece343bb0.jpg"},{"name":"All I See Is Blood I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/909320/a0c3cbde2b1ac73e22f126ad81b94b3ece343bb0.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/909320?t=1765900305","background_raw":"https://sto