older Structure allows you to spawn Eyes all over the world to gather information. You've seen a Knight steal a Shaman's Potion? Store it as an Intel and then tell the Shaman about it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/61e949e30f0931342d3458b578313755.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create a customized Plague</strong></h2>Build a Biolab to afflict Villagers with Plague and summon Plagued Rats. Upgrade your plague to instill it with various nasty symptoms and improve its virulence. You can even make Plagued victims explode when they die!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Infiltrate the Village secret Cultists</strong></h2>Captured villagers can be taken to your prison and brainwashed into cultists! Cultists will secretly worship you and aid your return into the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/090cdc24c78aa30f3de00a259911049c.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Start a Zombie Apocalypse</strong></h2>Make the Plagued dead rise as zombies. Other villagers that they attack may also contract the virus. Soon, the entire village will be filled with nothing but shambling zombies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.poster.avif?t=1765900305\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.webm?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/extras/a460abb652385ddbcb671c882e0df1f1.mp4?t=1765900305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unleash the Creatures of the Night</strong></h2>Afflict a Villager with Vampirism or Lycanthropy to turn them into denizens of the night. Watch as they terrorize their neighbors and spread the curse! You may eventually see the Village fight back and start Vampire and Lycan Hunts.","developers":["Maccima Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/909320/header.jpg?t=1765900305","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/909320/293968/d7ad0c8d0cb7392033b51db60e9a28dfe00dc80e/1751162643/dash_av1.mpd?t=1674487953","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/909320/293968/d7ad0c8d0cb7392033b51db60e9a28dfe00dc80e/1751162643/dash_h264.mpd?t=1674487953","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/909320/293968/d7ad0c8d0cb7392033b51db60e9a28dfe00dc80e/1751162643/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1674487953","id":256790260,"name":"Offici